/ Example MicroDDL demonstrating named index declarations.
/ Indexes are declared with `+` lines inside a table stanza:
/   +IndexName Col1[, Col2, ...]     regular index
/   +!IndexName Col1[, Col2, ...]    unique index

!User
@IDUser
$UserName 128
$Email 256
$PasswordHash 128
^Active
&CreateDate
+!AK_User_Username UserName
+!AK_User_Email Email
+IX_User_Active Active

!UserSession
@IDUserSession
#IDUser -> IDUser
$SessionToken 256
&LoginDate
&ExpirationDate
&CreateDate
+!AK_UserSession_Token SessionToken
+IX_UserSession_UserDate IDUser, LoginDate
